-- AMBIGUOUS CONSTRAINT ------------------------------------------- src/Main.fic

The constraint `b has zero` mentions the type variable `b`, but `b` does not
occur in the type of `size`:

14|         b has zero : b
            ^^^^^^^^^^
A constraint is solved from the types at each use of `size`, so every type
variable in it has to be part of the type of the function. Here no use of `size`
could say what `b` is.

Use `b` in the type of `size` (an argument or the result), or remove the
constraint.
